WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:12.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ ALARM ]
&gt;&gt;&gt; HEY FELLAS.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:21.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH!
&gt;&gt; WE DID IT, CAPTAIN SHADOW.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.790
&gt;&gt; BUT THE KILLER CLOWN HAS
STILL ELUDED US ONCE AGAIN.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.027
LET'S HURRY BACK TO HIS SHADOW
CAVE AND INSPECT THIS SERIOUS

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.295
CLUE THAT HE LEFT BEHIND.
&gt;&gt; THAT SICK BASTARD WILL NEVER

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
GET AWAY WITH WHATEVER HE IS
PLANNING, THANKS TO US.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DON'T GET TOO COCKY,
CARDINAL.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
KILLER CLOWN WILL STILL --
[ SIRENS ]

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
-- OH, GODDAMN IT.
IT'S THE COPS.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; TURN OFF THE ENGINE.
&gt;&gt; THEY PROBABLY JUST WANT TO

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
THANK US.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, I BET.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.315
LOOK, JUST BE COOL.
LET ME DO ALL THE TALKING, OKAY?

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
I WON'T SAY A WORD.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:55.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, FELLAS.
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HELLO, OFFICER.
&gt;&gt; NICE MASKS.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.126
WHAT ARE YOU GUYS, COMING FROM A
PARTY OR SOMETHING?

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.128
&gt;&gt; NO, SIR.
&gt;&gt; BUT I GUESS YOU COULD SAY WE

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUSTED ONE UP, RIGHT CAPTAIN
SHADOW?

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SHUT UP CARDINAL.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ANY IDEA HOW FAST YOU WERE
GOING?

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:09.769
&gt;&gt; UH, I MEAN -- I'M REALLY NOT
SURE.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:12.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
65, 70 MAYBE?
&gt;&gt; I CLOCKED YOU GUYS AT 140.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:16.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:17.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
LICENSE AND REGISTRATION,
PLEASE, SIR.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S ME.
IT'S CAPTAIN SHADOW.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS IS MY TRUSTY SIDEKICK
CARDINAL.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.983
&gt;&gt; THE DYNAMITE TWOSOME AT YOUR
SERVICE.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:26.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY CARDINAL, WILL YOU JUST
SHUT UP?

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY, SO YOU'RE RAPPERS OR
SOMETHING.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.123
I STILL NEED TO SEE I.D.
&gt;&gt; NO, WE'RE NOT RAPPERS.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:34.894
AND MY IDENTITY IS A SECRET, SO.
&gt;&gt; A SECRET.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.530
&gt;&gt; YEAH, I'M A CRIME FIGHTER.
&gt;&gt; YOU REALLY DON'T RECOGNIZE

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
US?
&gt;&gt; HOW OLD ARE YOU?

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; 16.
&gt;&gt; OH, GOD.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.303
&gt;&gt; IS THAT YOUR SON?
&gt;&gt; NO, BUT WE LIVE TOGETHER IN A

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
CAVE.
&gt;&gt; OKAY, OUT OF THE CAR.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.107
LET'S GO.
&gt;&gt; CARDINAL, THAT'S GOING TO BE

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOUR BIGGEST SETBACK.
YOU DON'T LISTEN.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:52.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT, YOU NEED HELP?
GET OUT.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:53.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.
&gt;&gt; BEEN DRINKING TODAY?

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO, SIR.
&gt;&gt; CAPTAIN SHADOW WOULD NEVER

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:56.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
DRINK.
&gt;&gt; HEY.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; UH-HUH.
YEAH, PRETTY SWEET RIDE YOU'VE

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:03.556
GOT.
YOU'VE GOT A FIRE COMING OUT OF

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:04.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE EXHAUST.
I DON'T SEE A LICENSE PLATE ON

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:05.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS THING.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WELL, OF COURSE NOT.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT'S THE SHADOW MOBILE, ALL
RIGHT?

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.728
I MADE THIS CAR MYSELF.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, BECAUSE HE'S A GENIUS.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY, WAS I TALKING TO YOU?
&gt;&gt; NO, BUT HE IS.

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:12.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
HANDS ON THE HOOD.

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.201
&gt;&gt; OKAY, I REALLY DON'T THINK --
&gt;&gt; LET'S GO, COME ON.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALRIGHTY.
DO YOU HAVE ANYTHING THAT WILL

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
STICK ME?
&gt;&gt; PROBABLY.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ANY WEAPONS OR GUNS?
&gt;&gt; CAPTAIN SHADOW WOULD NEVER

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
USE GUNS, BECAUSE GUNS ARE FOR
COWARDS.

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:27.080
RIGHT CAPTAIN SHADOW?
&gt;&gt; WOULD YOU SHUT UP, CARDINAL!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:27.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SURE.
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS THIS?

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:30.783 size:88% position:44%
&gt;&gt; IT'S MY UTILITY BELT.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WHAT'S ON IT?

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.386
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW -- SMOKE BOMBS.
STRAPS, GADGETS, THERE'S A

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:34.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
LOT --
&gt;&gt; UH-HUH.

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:37.991
&gt;&gt; THIS REALLY ISN'T NECESSARY.
JUST CALL COMMISSIONER MORGAN,

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
HE KNOWS WHO I AM.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:49.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
1085, I'M GOING TO NEED A CAR.
&gt;&gt; DAM IT, DAM IT, DAM IT.

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.037
ANY TIME A
BLACK MAN WANTS TO DO SOMETHING

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.505
GOOD FOR HIS COMMUNITY, WE'VE
GOT TO GO THROUGH SOMETHING LIKE

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS.
EVERY TIME.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:57.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S THIS?
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S WHAT?

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:58.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THE BAG.
WHAT'S IN IT?

00:02:58.511 --> 00:02:59.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S -- THAT'S DUST.
IT'S ENERGY DUST.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.548
&gt;&gt; OH, YEAH?
LOOKS A LITTLE BIT LIKE COCAINE.

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:02.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, PLEASE.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WELL -- IT'S NOT

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:07.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
COCAINE.
IT'S LIKE COCAINE, BUT IT'S

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:08.755
DIFFERENT.
&gt;&gt; HE JUST NEEDS IT, FOR ENERGY

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:09.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND FOR COURAGE.
&gt;&gt; SHUT YOUR TRAP.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, WHAT SEEMS TO BE
THE PROBLEM HERE?

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.125
HEY CAPTAIN SHADOW, WHAT'S GOING
ON MY BROTHER?

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHAT'S THIS RIGHT HERE?
OH, THAT'S COCAINE.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S NOT MINE.
IT'S NOT MINE.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HE JUST SAID IT WAS YOUR
ENERGY DUST.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DID I SAY THAT?
BUT IT'S NOT MINE.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:23.703
I PROBABLY CONFISCATED IT.
AND JUST FORGOT ABOUT IT.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.605
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, LET'S GO AHEAD AND
GET YOU SOME CUFFS.

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:28.474
&gt;&gt; WAIT -- WE DON'T NEED THOSE.
&gt;&gt; OH, NO.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
CAPTAIN SHADOW, WHAT SHOULD I
DO?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.178
&gt;&gt; CALL MY OLD LADY, TELL HER
THEY GOT ME AGAIN, CARDINAL.

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:36.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
♪♪♪

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:39.285 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

